      en: ["The age of the desert is estimated to be at least 55 million years.", "Dune 45 near Sossusvlei is one of the most famous formations.", "Annual rainfall is often less than 10 mm.", "The 'Sand Sea' covers an area of approximately 34,000 km².", "It is home to the Welwitschia plant, which can live up to 1,500 years.", "The Skeleton Coast is famous for its numerous shipwrecks."],
