      en: ["The highest peak reaches an elevation of 1,965 meters.", "Geology consists of Precambrian dolomite and limestone.", "Primary sanctuary for the endemic Hartmann's mountain zebra.", "Historical stronghold of Nama leader Hendrik Witbooi.", "The main Naukluft Hiking Trail spans 120 kilometers.", "Perennial springs create permanent crystal-clear rock pools."],
